Package: shinyVIVO
Title: Mixed-Methods Coding Workbench Using Local Language Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bernard Isekah", "Osangir", , "b.osangir@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Neudata Consulting Ltd", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: A 'shiny' workbench for qualitative and mixed-methods
    researchers who prefer not to write code. Upload a spreadsheet of text
    responses, code them against a set of themes with a local large
    language model served by 'Ollama' <https://ollama.com>, and compare a quantitative metric
    between texts with and without each theme. Text never leaves the
    researcher's machine. The coding, summary and plotting steps are also
    exported as functions for scripted use. Developed by Neudata Consulting
    Ltd.
